infographic list-column-simple-vertical-arrow
data
  title React 19 root error severity
  lists
    - label onUncaughtError — white-screen class
      desc No boundary caught it; the tree unmounted and the user saw it break. Page someone now.
    - label onCaughtError — handled class
      desc A boundary rendered its fallback; the user kept a working page. Watch the rate, never page single events.
    - label onRecoverableError — self-healed class
      desc React recovered on its own; hydration mismatches land here and the user saw nothing. Budget a metric, never alert.
theme
  palette #f43f5e #f59e0b #14b8a6
